# Operating System Security Governance Program for Unidad Web

## Executive Summary

Designed an enterprise security governance program for Unidad Web, a cloud services provider supporting more than 5,000 customers across the eastern United States.

The objective was to strengthen operating system security, reduce cyber risk, improve monitoring capabilities, and support compliance requirements across Windows, UNIX, and Linux environments.

---

# Business Overview

## Organization

Unidad Web provides:

- Website hosting
- Email services
- Content management systems
- Secure cloud storage

The organization maintains a hybrid infrastructure and manages sensitive customer information requiring strong cybersecurity controls.

